                                                "sense_id": "892eabc2-c055-3322-8ed1-05972ab3f395",
                                                "text": "Sound logic, as the habitual subordination of the individual to the species, and of the species to the genus […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "251ad7b2-47a0-3dd7-80aa-9029cf07204c",
